    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>268988</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>起動しないようだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It doesn't seem to work...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>64</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271304</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>落とし穴注意！！
下まで落ちちゃうぞ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Watch out for the pitfall!
You'll fall back down below~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>65</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271520</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>飽きもせず看板見ちゃうなんて、
案外細かい性格？？？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Do you not get tired of reading these?
Are you really that detail-oriented??</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>66</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271736</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>毎度毎度、看板チェック
ご苦労様ですね☆</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Checking every signpost, huh?
Great work out there~!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>67</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271952</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わざわざ戻ってくるなんて
ご苦労さん∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You really came all the way back
here? Such a good effort, thanks~!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>68</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
